[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2161.43, "timestamp": "00:36:01", "text": "这。好的，我需要升级一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2164.55, "timestamp": "00:36:04", "text": "那时就是这样。哎哟。哎哟。太感谢了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2167.19, "timestamp": "00:36:07", "text": "谢谢你救了我。我的天啊。谢谢。呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2169.43, "timestamp": "00:36:09", "text": "但你知道吗？我有点……我有点……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2171.19, "timestamp": "00:36:11", "text": "我当时想着我会和他上床。现在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2173.43, "timestamp": "00:36:13", "text": "我不知道。我要去思考一下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2176.63, "timestamp": "00:36:16", "text": "关于那件事。再见。等等，该怎么做？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2179.88, "timestamp": "00:36:19", "text": "我起床？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2193.829, "timestamp": "00:36:33", "text": "等等，等等。发生了什么事？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2197.47, "timestamp": "00:36:37", "text": "肯尼怎么了？等等，什么？什么是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2201.39, "timestamp": "00:36:41", "text": "这？不，他的……等等，这是故障吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2204.43, "timestamp": "00:36:44", "text": "不，是他的脸。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2211.349, "timestamp": "00:36:51", "text": "等等，这是不，不，不，不，不吗？什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2212.87, "timestamp": "00:36:52", "text": "你遇到过这种情况吗？我的天啊。什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2214.96, "timestamp": "00:36:54", "text": "你的脸怎么了？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2216.15, "timestamp": "00:36:56", "text": "[音乐]"}]